OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FThe UK's largest train operator is
OL,7,Ftemporarily stopping passengers from
OL,8,Fbuying digital tickets at some
OL,9,Fstations, in a new trial aimed at
OL,10,Fcracking down on fare evasion.
OL,12,FInstead, customers will only be able
OL,13,Fto print off their tickets when
OL,14,Ftravelling from certain stations.
OL,16,FGreater Thameslink Railway (GTR),
OL,17,Fwhich runs Southern, Thameslink, Great
OL,18,FNorthern and the Gatwick Express, said
OL,19,Fthey have launched the three-month
OL,20,Ftrial to stop the abuse of e-tickets
OL,21,Fand so-called "short-faring".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
