OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FThis is where a passenger buys a
OL,7,Fticket for only part of their journey
OL,8,For only buys one when challenged for
OL,9,Finspection.
OL,11,FSouth Western Railway (SWR) has also
OL,12,Fsaid short-faring is a significant
OL,13,Fproblem and is costing them millions
OL,14,Fof pounds. They have launched their
OL,15,Fown crackdown.
OL,17,FSo what is short-faring and why are
OL,18,Frail operators cracking down on it?
OL,19,FITV News explains.
OL,21,FWhat is short-faring?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
