PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786054681
OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FShort-faring is a form of ticket
OL,7,Fevasion, where people deliberately buy
OL,8,Fa ticket for only part of their
OL,9,Fjourney to save on the cost of a full
OL,10,Fticket, or only when challenged.
OL,12,FFor example, someone travelling from
OL,13,FDevon to London Waterloo may only buy
OL,14,Ftheir ticket when they arrive in
OL,15,FVauxhall. They can still scan their
OL,16,Fticket using their phone at Waterloo
OL,17,Fto get through the barriers and
OL,18,Ftherefore save on the cost of their
OL,19,Fticket.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
