OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786054681
OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FIt is a criminal offence under the
OL,7,FRegulation of Railways Act 1889, and
OL,8,Frepeat offenders can face prosecution.
OL,10,FPassengers caught without the right
OL,11,Fticket are fined #100, which is halved
OL,12,Fif they pay within 21 days, as well as
OL,13,Fpurchasing a single ticket for their
OL,14,Fjourney.
OL,16,FHow much of a problem is it?
OL,18,FFare evasion is estimated to cost the
OL,19,Findustry #400 million a year,
OL,20,Faccording to industry body the Rail
OL,21,FDelivery Group
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
