OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FGTR said they believe up to 95% of
OL,7,Fshort-fare tickets are used
OL,8,Ffraudulently, and that the number of
OL,9,Ftickets bought immediately before
OL,10,Fusing them on a ticket gate is not
OL,11,Fconsistent with customer buying
OL,12,Fpatterns.
OL,14,FSWR also said it had identified
OL,15,Fwidespread misuse of electronic
OL,16,Ftickets.
OL,18,FSince June, SWR's trial has identified
OL,19,F153 short-faring offences, compared
OL,20,Fwith seven during the same period last
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
