OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786054681
OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FIt also found that up to 95% of
OL,7,Fbarcode tickets purchased for the four-
OL,8,Fminute journey between Vauxhall and
OL,9,FLondon Waterloo were being used
OL,10,Ffraudulently, putting #1 million of
OL,11,Frevenue at risk.
OL,13,FThese tickets open the barriers at
OL,14,FLondon Waterloo, and are considerably
OL,15,Fcheaper than for long-distance
OL,16,Fjourneys on SWR's network.
OL,18,FWhat is being done about it?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
