OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786054681
OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FGTR said their scheme aims to stop the
OL,7,Fabuse of the e-ticket system by only
OL,8,Fpurchasing tickets when challenged.
OL,10,FThey said they will know if ticket
OL,11,Ffacilities are not available at
OL,12,Fstations and a physical ticket is
OL,13,Funable to be bought.
OL,15,FMeanwhile, SWR said they have deployed
OL,16,Fmore revenue protection staff at
OL,17,FVauxhall to ensure everyone who enters
OL,18,Fthe station with an electronic ticket
OL,19,Fhas it scanned.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
