OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786054681
OL,3,CShort-faring: What is it and how are
OL,4,Crail operators cracking down?
OL,6,FWhen a fare dodger arrives at London
OL,7,FWaterloo with an electronic ticket
OL,8,Ffrom Vauxhall that was not scanned at
OL,9,Fthe start of the journey, it is
OL,10,Fapparent they have travelled from
OL,11,Ffurther away.
OL,13,FEarly data suggests about a third of
OL,14,Fpassengers previously identified by
OL,15,FSWR as conducting the short-faring
OL,16,Fscam are now purchasing the correct
OL,17,Fticket for their journey.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
